{"channelId":"UC3Kntpcobf92RW7g4-iimFw","row":["ASPH Physiotherapy",721,"The physiotherapy service serves the population in the areas surrounding Ashford and St Peters Foundation NHS trust, for both in patient and out patient care.\nThe aim of physiotherapy is to assist patients of all ages in identifying and maximising their movement potential and improving their quality of life.\n\nWe have a variety of in patient teams including respiratory/medical, surgical, orthopaedic, neurological and paediatric teams, who cover all acute admissions at the St Peters site, and offer quality post-operative and rehabilitation services at the Ashford hospital site.\n\n\nThese videos were developed for patients attending ASPH Physiotherapy.  You can follow the advice provided within these videos at your own risk and seek professional physiotherapy advice to help further if required.","","United Kingdom"],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC3Kntpcobf92RW7g4-iimFw","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC3Kntpcobf92RW7g4-iimFw","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:18:21.183Z","channelId":"UC3Kntpcobf92RW7g4-iimFw","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"9c3d4ce9826ccd423f970465554987691af6dc1b9b6d3e163c279f21a14779fd","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"a81860e9fabf7595962128bf1f076076ad031161ddac878f221dc505904a8e50"},"countrySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC3Kntpcobf92RW7g4-iimFw","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:18:21.183Z"},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC3Kntpcobf92RW7g4-iimFw","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":721,"raw":"721 subscribers","precision":"exact","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC3Kntpcobf92RW7g4-iimFw","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:18:21.183Z"}],"emails":[],"contactPages":[],"matchedKeywords":[],"relevantKeywords":[],"priorityKeywords":[],"quality":[{"keyword":"physical therapist","relevant":false,"evidenceLevel":"name_only","role":"un